@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@notificationId =

### List notifications (session cookie from auth.http login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?limit=20

###
### Next page: pass nextCursor from the previous response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?cursor=2026-10-26T12:00:00.000Z_507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

###
### Mark one as read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Origin: {{baseUrl}}

###
### Mark all as read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Origin: {{baseUrl}}

###
### Web Push public config (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/push/vapid-public-key

###
### Register a device (PushSubscription.toJSON() from the browser; needs VAPID_* configured)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/push/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}

{
  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/EXAMPLE",
  "keys": { "p256dh": "BASE64URL_P256DH", "auth": "BASE64URL_AUTH" }
}

###
### Cancel a device
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/push/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}

{ "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/EXAMPLE" }

###
### Send a test notification to your own account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/push/test
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Accept-Language: pt
